<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="756728"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537238705"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="oblivious"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Kalafina"/><amll:meta key="album" value="oblivious"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:22.373"><div begin="00:45.678" end="04:00.841"><p begin="00:45.678" end="00:52.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:45.678" end="00:52.780">本当は空を飛べると知っていたから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因为早已知晓自己能够飞翔</span></p><p begin="00:53.242" end="01:00.513" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:53.242" end="01:00.513">羽ばたくときが怖くて風を忘れた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才会害怕那一刻的来临 连风也已遗忘</span></p><p begin="01:00.513" end="01:02.138" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="01:00.513" end="01:02.138">Oblivious</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经忘记 将要去向何方</span></p><p begin="01:02.138" end="01:04.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="01:02.138" end="01:04.091">何処へ行くの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们应该去往何方</span></p><p begin="01:04.091" end="01:08.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:04.091" end="01:08.571">遠くに見えるあの蜃気楼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远远望见的那片海市蜃楼</span></p><p begin="01:08.571" end="01:11.674" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:08.571" end="01:11.674">いつか怯えながら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天 也会用那缥缈光芒</span></p><p begin="01:11.674" end="01:20.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:11.674" end="01:20.444">二人の未来を映して</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">映出我们未来的模样</span></p><p begin="01:31.561" end="01:38.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:31.561" end="01:38.839">よるべない心二つ寄り添う頃に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当两颗无依无靠的心相互依偎</span></p><p begin="01:39.377" end="01:46.477" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:39.377" end="01:46.477">本当の悲しみがほら翼広げて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实真正的悲伤刚刚对着我们张开翅膀</span></p><p begin="01:46.477" end="01:48.162" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:46.477" end="01:48.162">Oblivious</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经忘记 仿佛在黑夜中</span></p><p begin="01:48.162" end="01:50.119" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:48.162" end="01:50.119">夜の中で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这其实是一场黑夜</span></p><p begin="01:50.119" end="01:54.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:50.119" end="01:54.680">真昼の影を夢見るように</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还以为梦见了白昼的阴影</span></p><p begin="01:54.680" end="01:57.773" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:54.680" end="01:57.773">きっと堕ちて行こう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天我们也会一同坠落</span></p><p begin="01:57.773" end="02:02.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:57.773" end="02:02.799">光へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着光芒的方向</span></p><p begin="02:17.379" end="02:23.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="02:17.379" end="02:23.030">いつか 君と 二人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天 我将与你一同</span></p><p begin="02:23.030" end="02:32.634" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:23.030" end="02:32.634">夜を 朝を 昼を 星を 幻想を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿越黑夜 黎明 白昼 星辰 幻想</span></p><p begin="02:32.634" end="02:40.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:32.634" end="02:40.243">夏を 冬を 時を 風を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿越盛夏 寒冬 时光 清风</span></p><p begin="02:40.243" end="02:46.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:40.243" end="02:46.029">水を 土を 空を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿越水流 大地 空气</span></p><p begin="02:46.029" end="02:53.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:46.029" end="02:53.998">We go further in the destiny</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们走向更深远的命运...</span></p><p begin="03:03.806" end="03:11.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="03:03.806" end="03:11.023">本当は空を飛べると知っていたから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因为知道可以在空中翱翔</span></p><p begin="03:11.445" end="03:20.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="03:11.445" end="03:20.528">羽ばたくときが怖くて風を忘れた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才会畏惧展翅的那一刻而忘却疾风</span></p><p begin="03:16.799" end="03:24.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="03:16.799" end="03:24.439">We go further in the destiny</span></p><p begin="03:24.439" end="03:26.034" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="03:24.439" end="03:26.034">Oblivious</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使忘记了 也请陪在我身边</span></p><p begin="03:26.034" end="03:27.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="03:26.034" end="03:27.972">側にいてね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要有你陪伴身旁</span></p><p begin="03:27.972" end="03:32.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="03:27.972" end="03:32.522">静かな恋がほら始まるよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这场爱情也会静静地启航</span></p><p begin="03:32.522" end="03:35.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="03:32.522" end="03:35.625">いつか震えながら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天 会在微微的颤抖中</span></p><p begin="03:35.625" end="03:39.758" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="03:35.625" end="03:39.758">二人の未来へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驶向我们未来的方向</span></p><p begin="03:39.758" end="03:41.482" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="03:39.758" end="03:41.482">Oblivious</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经忘记 将要去向何方</span></p><p begin="03:41.482" end="03:43.398" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="03:41.482" end="03:43.398">何処へ行くの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们应该去向何方</span></p><p begin="03:43.398" end="03:47.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="03:43.398" end="03:47.855">遠くへ逃げてゆく水の中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这条渐渐逃向远方的水流</span></p><p begin="03:47.855" end="03:51.006" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:47.855" end="03:51.006">何て綺麗な声で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此时此刻 正用它清澈的声响</span></p><p begin="03:51.006" end="03:54.893" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:51.006" end="03:54.893">二人の未来を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为我们的未来</span></p><p begin="03:54.893" end="04:00.841" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:54.893" end="04:00.841">歌って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声歌唱</span></p></div></body></tt>